\pard\qc\keepn\sb0\sa300\b\cf1\fs36 SAI Platform and FSA Document Instruction Guide\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Purpose:\b0  Help farmers, Farm Management Group (FMG) Coordinators, buyers, sustainability managers, scheme owners, and verification-preparation teams understand which SAI Platform and Farm Sustainability Assessment (FSA) documents to use, when to use them, and how they fit together.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Document set reviewed:\b0  Repository documents available as of June 12, 2026. Always confirm that the version being used remains current before beginning a new assessment, benchmark, verification, or public claim.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Word-compatible copy:\b0  Open \f1\cf2 SAI-Platform-FSA-Document-Instruction-Guide.rtf\f0\cf1  in Microsoft Word or another compatible word processor. The RTF format is text-based so it can be reviewed and included in repository pull requests that do not support binary DOCX files.\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb300\sa120\b\cf1\fs28 1. Start Here: How the Documents Work Together\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 The FSA documents form a connected implementation and improvement system rather than a set of independent references.\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 1.\tab Read the \b FSA Implementation Framework\b0  to define the purpose, scope, roles, management system, and verification approach.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 2.\tab Establish the farm or FMG, appoint responsibilities, and complete priority screening.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 3.\tab Complete the \b FSA Self-Assessment Questionnaire (SAQ)\b0  to assess farm practices and identify performance gaps.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 4.\tab Use the \b FSA 3.0 Training Toolkit\b0  to explain individual SAQ questions and expected evidence to farmers.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 5.\tab Use the \b Continuous Improvement Module\b0  to turn priorities and gaps into a documented Continuous Improvement Plan (CIP).\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 6.\tab Use the \b Outcome Measurement Handbook\b0  to select tools and measure results such as greenhouse-gas emissions, soil health, biodiversity, and water outcomes.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 7.\tab Follow the \b Implementation Framework\b0  when preparing for verification and making verified FSA claims.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 8.\tab After an FMG receives a Letter of Attestation, use the \b FMG Verification Audit Annual Reporting Template\b0  at the required anniversaries.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 9.\tab If farms already participate in another sustainability scheme, check the \b FSA Benchmarking Results\b0  and use the \b Benchmarking Protocol\b0  before duplicating direct FSA implementation.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 10.\tab Use the \b SAI Platform RTF\u8211?NIAB Database\b0  as supporting evidence when selecting regenerative-agriculture practices, not as a replacement for FSA assessment or verification.\par
\pard\par
