\pard\keepn\sb300\sa120\b\cf1\fs28 3. Recommended FSA Implementation Workflow\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\b\cf2\fs24 Phase 1 \u8212? Define the program\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Agree why FSA is being implemented and what claims or customer requirements it must support.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Define the crop, product, farm, FMG, geography, and volume scope.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Appoint an FMG Coordinator or responsible person.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Establish management, recordkeeping, sampling, and volume-accounting processes.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Confirm whether direct FSA implementation is necessary or an existing benchmarked scheme can be used.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Primary document:\b0  FSA Implementation Framework V3.0.\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\b\cf2\fs24 Phase 2 \u8212? Assess current practice\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Complete priority screening to identify locally material sustainability topics.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Have the required farms complete the SAQ using Yes, No, or Not Applicable responses.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Retain evidence for every Yes response and justification for every permitted Not Applicable response.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Review the calculated performance level and topic-level gaps.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Primary documents:\b0  FSA Self-Assessment Questionnaire V3.0.1 and FSA 3.0 Training Toolkit.\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\b\cf2\fs24 Phase 3 \u8212? Plan improvement\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Select meaningful priority topics using priority screening, SAQ gaps, and farmer/stakeholder input.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Establish baselines and measurable targets.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Define activities, owners, deadlines, monitoring, and adjustments.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Record progress internally at least annually.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Primary document:\b0  FSA Continuous Improvement Module V3.0.\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\b\cf2\fs24 Phase 4 \u8212? Measure outcomes\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Decide what outcome must be measured and why.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Select an appropriate scale, methodology, and tool.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Establish a consistent baseline and data-collection method.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Repeat measurement consistently and use results to improve the CIP.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Primary document:\b0  FSA Outcome Measurement Handbook V3.1.\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\b\cf2\fs24 Phase 5 \u8212? Verify and maintain claims\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Select an appropriate Verification Body and prepare the management system and sampled farms for audit.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Retain the Letter of Attestation and supporting verification records.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Submit FMG composition reports at the required year-one and year-two anniversaries.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Monitor membership turnover and growth to determine whether another farm-performance audit is triggered.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Primary documents:\b0  FSA Implementation Framework V3.0 and FMG Verification Audit Annual Reporting Template.\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb300\sa120\b\cf1\fs28 4. Document-by-Document Instructions\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb220\sa100\b\cf2\fs24 4.1 FSA Implementation Framework V3.0\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b Repository file:\b0  \f1\cf2 fsa-implementation-framework-v3.0.-eng.pdf\f0\cf1 \par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b What it contains\b0 \par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Purpose, scope, governance, and formal status of FSA.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Roles of farms, FMGs, FMG Coordinators, buyers, Verification Bodies, and SAI Platform.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Description of the SAQ, priority screening, continuous improvement, outcome measurement, verification, benchmarking, and supply-chain modules.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Step-by-step implementation requirements.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab FMG setup, sampling, volume accounting, verification, performance claims, and Letters of Attestation.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b When to use it\b0 \par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Before starting an FSA program.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab When determining program scope and responsibilities.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab When setting up an FMG management system or volume-accounting system.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab When preparing for initial verification, re-verification, or claims.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Whenever a question concerns a formal FSA implementation requirement.\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 \b How to use it\b0 \par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Create a checklist based on the six implementation steps.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Assign an owner and evidence location to each applicable requirement.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use it as the controlling implementation reference; supporting guides do not replace its requirements.\par
\pard\par
