\pard\keepn\sb300\sa120\b\cf1\fs28 9. Version-Control Reminder\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\sa120\fs21\cf1 The documents in this repository include different versions and dates. In particular, the Benchmarking Results workbook is dated December 12, 2025. Before beginning an assessment, verification, benchmark, or public claim:\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Confirm that the document version remains current.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Record the exact version used.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Check whether a benchmark result has expired or its scope has changed.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Retain the version used as part of the program records.\par
\pard\par
\pard\keepn\sb300\sa120\b\cf1\fs28 10. Final Practical Summary\b0\cf1\fs21\par
\pard\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b Implementation Framework\b0  to design and govern the FSA program.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b SAQ\b0  to assess farm practices and calculate indicative performance.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b Training Toolkit\b0  to explain and teach the SAQ.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b Continuous Improvement Module\b0  to turn gaps into action.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b Outcome Measurement Handbook\b0  to measure real-world results.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b Benchmarking Results and Protocol\b0  to recognize other sustainability schemes appropriately.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b Annual Reporting Template\b0  to maintain an FMG Letter of Attestation between audits.\par
\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\fs21\cf1 \bullet\tab Use the \b RTF\u8211?NIAB Database\b0  as evidence to inform regenerative-agriculture decisions.\par
